  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, as an action, you can make a Charisma (Persuasion) check contested by a creature's Wisdom (Insight) check. If you succeed and the creature is hostile, it has disadvantage on attack rolls against targets other than you and can't make opportunity attacks against targets other than you for 1 minute or until an ally damages it. If the creature is not hostile, it is charmed by you for 1 minute or until you or your allies do anything harmful to it.</p>",
